@startuml
title SD-F02A — Product editor and photo persistence
caption FN-CAT-01–04 · To-Be · Frontend, Catalogue and object storage
actor Merchant
actor Customer
boundary "Product Editor" as UI
control "Catalogue API" as API
database PostgreSQL as DB
collections "Catalogue objects" as Blob
Merchant -> UI : Edit draft and choose image
UI -> API : Upload bytes for owned merchant product
API -> API : Check admin, size, type and decoded content
alt Valid image
 API -> Blob : Write immutable normalized image
 API -> DB : Stage media for this product
 API --> UI : Stage ID and protected preview
 Merchant -> UI : Reorder, replace or remove; save
 UI -> API : PUT product with If-Match and ordered media IDs
 API -> DB : Lock product and replace gallery atomically
 alt Current version and valid IDs
  DB --> API : Saved version, audit and current gallery
  API --> UI : Refresh saved product
 else Conflict or foreign media
  API --> UI : Preserve draft and prior saved gallery
 end
else Invalid or failed upload
 API --> UI : Actionable error; keep saved gallery
end
Customer -> API : Read photo for listed product
API -> DB : Verify session and current attachment
API -> Blob : Read authorized media only
@enduml
